OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785383018
OL,3,CParents set to spend average 88 hours
OL,4,Con unintended phone scrolling over
OL,5,Csummer
OL,7,FParents of under-18s are set to spend
OL,8,Fan average 88 hours on unintended
OL,9,Fphone scrolling over the summer
OL,10,Fholiday, a survey suggests.
OL,12,FMore than half of children aged eight
OL,13,Fto 16 (56%) say their parents' phone
OL,14,Fuse causes them to miss important
OL,15,Ffamily moments, while 63% believe
OL,16,Ftheir parents do not realise how much
OL,17,Ftime they spend on their phones, the
OL,18,Fsurvey for Virgin Media O2 found.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
