FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785383018
OL,3,CParents set to spend average 88 hours
OL,4,Con unintended phone scrolling over
OL,5,Csummer
OL,7,FAn 18-month study involving 16,000
OL,8,Fpeople by the media giant found
OL,9,Fparents of under-18s spend more than
OL,10,Ftwo hours a day using their
OL,11,Fsmartphones unintentionally, and are
OL,12,Fsignificantly more likely than non-
OL,13,Fparents to fall into unintentional
OL,14,Fsmartphone habits.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785383018
OL,3,CParents set to spend average 88 hours
OL,4,Con unintended phone scrolling over
OL,5,Csummer
OL,7,FHalf of parents of under-18s (50%)
OL,8,Fsaid they have little to no control
OL,9,Fover how they use their phone and the
OL,10,Finternet, leaving them on track to
OL,11,Fspend almost four full days of the
OL,12,Fsummer holidays using their
OL,13,Fsmartphones unintentionally.
OL,15,FMore than three quarters of parents of
OL,16,Funder-18s (76%) said they often picked
OL,17,Fup their phone without thinking,
OL,18,Fcompared with 57% of non-parents.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785383018
OL,3,CParents set to spend average 88 hours
OL,4,Con unintended phone scrolling over
OL,5,Csummer
OL,7,FAlmost half (48%) check or pick up
OL,8,Ftheir phone 30 or more times a day
OL,9,Fwithout a specific reason and, as a
OL,10,Fresult, spend two hours and six
OL,11,Fminutes on their phone unintentionally
OL,12,Fevery day ` around 40 minutes longer
OL,13,Fthan the average UK adult, the survey
OL,14,Fsuggests.
OL,16,FAlmost three in four parents (74%)
OL,17,Fsaid using their phone after a long
OL,18,Fday helps them relax, and 80% say
OL,19,Fbeing online helps them stay in touch
OL,20,Fwhen life gets busy.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
