PN,30305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785383018
OL,3,CParents set to spend average 88 hours
OL,4,Con unintended phone scrolling over
OL,5,Csummer
OL,7,FAlmost half of children (48%) said
OL,8,Fthey have had to repeat themselves
OL,9,Fbecause a parent was using their
OL,10,Fphone, while 34% said a parent had
OL,11,Fmissed something they wanted to show
OL,12,Fthem.
OL,14,FAsked when they most wanted parents to
OL,15,Fbe fully present, children referred to
OL,16,Feveryday moments including talking
OL,17,Ftogether (47%), family days out (40%),
OL,18,Fand playing together (35%).
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
