CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785383018
OL,3,CParents set to spend average 88 hours
OL,4,Con unintended phone scrolling over
OL,5,Csummer
OL,7,FVirgin Media O2 has launched a
OL,8,F"digital intentionality score" to
OL,9,Fallow people to understand how they
OL,10,Fuse their phones, and compare their
OL,11,Fbehaviour against the national average
OL,12,Fof 63 out of 100 ` with higher scores
OL,13,Frepresenting more intentional use.
OL,15,FThe 10-question tool draws on both
OL,16,Freal usage data and self-reported
OL,17,Fhabits to provide a clearer picture of
OL,18,Fhow people engage with their phones.
OL,26,@pD@AOUpD@^O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
