OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785383018
OL,3,CParents set to spend average 88 hours
OL,4,Con unintended phone scrolling over
OL,5,Csummer
OL,7,FDana Haidan, chief sustainability
OL,8,Fofficer at Virgin Media O2, said:
OL,9,F"Summer holidays are a chance for
OL,10,Ffamilies to spend quality time
OL,11,Ftogether, but we know modern family
OL,12,Flife is busy, and parents are often
OL,13,Fbalancing work, childcare, and
OL,14,Feverything in between.
OL,16,F"Our research shows many are getting
OL,17,Fcaught in unintentional phone habits
OL,18,Fwithout even realising it.
OL,20,F"This isn't simply about individual
OL,21,Fbehaviour.
OL,26,@qD@AOUxD@AOU|D@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785383018
OL,3,CParents set to spend average 88 hours
OL,4,Con unintended phone scrolling over
OL,5,Csummer
OL,7,F"Many of the digital services we use
OL,8,Fevery day are designed to keep us
OL,9,Fengaged, making it easy to spend
OL,10,Flonger on our phones than we intended.
OL,12,F"Understanding those habits is the
OL,13,Ffirst step towards building a
OL,14,Fhealthier relationship with
OL,15,Ftechnology."
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@AOUwD@LO]
