OL,3,CParents set to spend average 88 hours
OL,4,Con unintended phone scrolling over
OL,5,Csummer
OL,7,FStrand Partners surveyed 6,002
OL,8,Fsmartphone owners between April 4-10,
OL,9,F6,136 people between March 11-16,
OL,10,F2,039 people between November 28 and
OL,11,FDecember 1, and 1,004 people between
OL,12,FDecember 18-20.
OL,14,FCensuswide surveyed 1,000 UK children
OL,15,Faged eight to 16 between July 10-14.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/9
